        {
          "text": "Mikwenda ri Saridi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ri malaika ma kitipa pa jom'oyeyo ma Saridi ndiki ama: Me mikwenda ma wok bongi ŋata nitie gi Cuny m'omakere abirio mapa Were kodi micalin abirio. Aŋeyo tim perin; itere pa ŋata kwo ma to itieko tho! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo cew, aka imedi tic kwoŋ nyaka gima fodi inigine, ma fodi k'otho je, rupiri fodi akinen i tim perin gim'otire ruwaŋ Were paran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.43+MAT.24.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24:43-44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.39+LUK.12.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 12:39-40",
