            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.43.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 43:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere onyo akidho kelo kitipa ma ji pa Sitan, ma jotwodo aka joŋoyo nike jobedo Joyuda, ma to jok'obedo; abino kelo jo bongin to jogoyo congi gin piny ruwaŋin to joniaŋ ni kere amarin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwoŋbedo ikuro or paran ma diyo ici gi ciro candirok; abino kurin maber i ndir ma teko obin'iye ri piny gipi ma temo ji je. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abino mayot; maki maber gim'inigine, aka moro wokiri womayin sangaria perin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
